<Base title="About" description="Puzzle game research from US store listings and sampled player reviews." path="/about/">
  <main class="wrap section"><h1>About</h1><p>puzzlereviewlab publishes research on US casual and puzzle games on iOS and Android. Articles distinguish developer claims from sampled player reports and disclose AI assistance and evidence limits. The current catalog has not been playtested and has no editorial scores. Numeric rankings are reserved for hands-on reviews with evidence for all five dimensions.</p></main>
